&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dataset:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/edumagalhaes/quality-prediction-in-a-mining-process" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"&gt;Kaggle — Quality Prediction in a Mining Process&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Notebook:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href="https://deepnote.com/app/data-analystics-accelerator/Mining-Project-7983f6fd-8b68-4392-811b-e4f6145de140" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"&gt;View on Deepnote&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
